  "locales": {
    "en": {
      "办公文档工坊 · Office 与 PDF 精加工套件": "Doc Studio · Offline Office & PDF Finishing Suite",
      "面向知识管理、法务审校、方案整理与科研文献精加工的全离线办公文档套件：集成「Office 文档透视镜」（零第三方依赖解析 Word .docx / PowerPoint .pptx 含演讲者备注 / 中文 .rtf、后台自动写入活页全局全文搜索、沉浸式纸张与幻灯片阅读、转存库内 Markdown 笔记与直接导出到本地不入库）与「PDF 手术台与精加工工坊」（零依赖调用 macOS 原生 PDFKit/CoreGraphics 完成合并、重排旋转、精准拆分、中文矢量斜角水印、高清转图、图片合 PDF 与大纲文本提取，全操作支持入库与直接导出到本地双去向），并联袂压缩包透视镜、表格与数据透视镜、批注及 7 个生态整理插件。": "All-offline office document and PDF finishing suite for knowledge management, legal review, proposals, and research papers: pairs Office Lens (zero-dependency Word .docx, PowerPoint .pptx with speaker notes, and Chinese .rtf reader with automatic global FTS indexing, library Markdown note capture, and direct-to-disk export) with PDF Forge (zero-dependency macOS PDFKit/CoreGraphics merging, page reorganization/rotation, range splitting, diagonal Chinese vector watermarks, HD image rendering, images-to-PDF, and outline/text extraction supporting both library ingest and direct folder export), alongside Archive Peek, Data Lens, Annotations, and 7 core organization plugins.",
      "文档精读与全文检索": "Document Reading & Search",
      "以青瓷纸面视觉组织 Word、PowerPoint、中文 RTF 与 PDF 文献库：主工作区一键切换「全部」「Office 文档」「PDF」标签，后台自动提取正文、表格、批注与 PPT 演讲者备注进入活页全局全文检索，左侧智能容器随阅读器自动切出筛选与文档目录。": "Celadon paper reading workspace for Word, PowerPoint, Chinese RTF, and PDF libraries: switch between All, Office Documents, and PDF tabs with automatic global FTS indexing of body text, tables, comments, and PowerPoint speaker notes plus contextual outline tools.",
      "PDF 手术与批量加工": "PDF Surgery & Finishing",
      "面向高频 PDF 合并、重排旋转、精准拆分、中文矢量水印、高清转图与多图合 PDF 的专业加工台：主工作区聚焦 PDF 片库与全库台账视图，并联动 Office 文档与数据表格标签，随时切换「导入当前仓库」或「直接导出到本地（不入库）」。": "High-throughput PDF surgery workbench for merging, rotating, splitting, diagonal Chinese watermarks, HD rendering, and images-to-PDF: centers on PDF masonry and full catalog table views alongside Office Documents and Data Tables, with one-click switching between Library Ingest and Direct Folder Export.",
      "preview": "Previews",
      "pdf": "PDF",
      "image": "Image",
      "text": "Text",
      "预览": "Previews",
      "PDF": "PDF",
      "图片": "Image",
      "文字": "Text",
      "Office 文档透视镜 · Office Lens": "Office Lens · Offline Document Reader & Full-Text Engine",
      "PDF 手术台与精加工工坊 · PDF Forge": "PDF Forge · PDF Surgical & Finishing Studio",
      "压缩包免解压透视镜 · Archive Peek": "Archive Peek · No-Extract Archive Inspector",
      "表格与数据透视镜 · Data Lens": "Data Lens · Tabular Explorer & Chart Studio",
      "批注": "Annotations",
      "组": "Folders",
      "标签基础": "Tags",
      "标签分组": "Tag groups",
      "评分": "Rating",
      "状态": "Status",
      "笔记": "Notes",
      "表格": "Table",
      "档案与数据透视 · 压缩包免解压与表格分析套件": "Archive & Data Lens · No-Extract Archive & Tabular Analysis Suite",
      "面向研发、运营、数据分析师与素材整理者的全离线档案与表格透视套件：集成「压缩包免解压透视镜」（O(1) 毫秒级解析 ZIP/ZIP64/TAR/TAR.GZ 目录、全局免解压搜内部文件名、图片/文本/SVG/Hex 在线预检与按需单个提取入库）与「表格与数据透视镜」（零依赖解析 CSV/TSV/多表 XLSX/JSON/JSONL、10 万行虚拟滚动表格、列分布直方图统计、交互图表工坊与 5 格式互转），并可选联动「格式魔方」与「批注」形成素材包免解压提取 → 表格分析 / 批量转码闭环。": "All-offline archive inspection and tabular analytics suite for engineers, analysts, and asset curators: combines Archive Peek (O(1) ZIP/ZIP64/TAR/TAR.GZ indexing, global search over archived filenames, no-extract preview & selective extraction to library) with Data Lens (zero-dependency CSV/TSV/multi-sheet XLSX/JSON/JSONL explorer, virtualized 100k-row grid, column histograms, interactive charts & 5-format export), optionally paired with Format Forge and Annotations.",
      "档案与数据透视 · 压缩包与表格": "Archive & Data Lens · Archives & Tables",
      "聚焦压缩包免解压检索提取与表格数据分析：启用压缩包免解压透视镜（ZIP/ZIP64/TAR/TAR.GZ）与表格与数据透视镜（CSV/TSV/XLSX/JSON/JSONL），配合来源、自定义字段、标签、评分、笔记与表格视图，主工作区一键切换「全部」「压缩包」「数据表格」。": "Focused workspace for no-extract archive inspection and tabular analytics, enabling Archive Peek and Data Lens alongside Source, Custom Fields, Tags, Rating, Notes, and Table views with All, Archives, and Data Tables tabs.",
      "档案加工全套 · 透视 + 表格 + 批转 + 批注": "Archive & Data Pro · Peek + Tables + Convert + Annotate",
      "在压缩包透视与表格分析基础上追加「格式魔方」（批量格式转换与压图转码）与「批注」（图文/PDF 局部摘录标注），完整打通「素材包免解压筛选提取 → 表格分析/图表入库 → 格式批量转码与摘录归档」全链路闭环。": "Full production suite adding Format Forge (batch media conversion & optimization) and Annotations (region/text/PDF excerpts) for an end-to-end selective archive extraction, tabular charting, and batch conversion pipeline.",
      "格式魔方 · 批量格式转换与压图工坊": "Format Forge · Batch Converter & Image Optimizer",
      "来源": "Source",
      "自定义字段": "Custom fields",
      "办公与档案工坊": "Documents & Archives Studio",
      "面向日常文档、数据表与归档包的全离线工作台：直读 Word/PPT/RTF 与全文检索、PDF 合并拆分水印、压缩包免解压检索以及十万行表格分析。": "Offline desk for office files, spreadsheets, and archives: Word/PPT/RTF reading and full-text search, PDF surgery, no-extract archive peeking, and 100k-row data tables.",
      "阅读 DOCX、PPTX、RTF 与 PDF，正文与演讲者备注自动进入全局全文搜索。": "Read Word, PowerPoint, RTF, and PDF with automatic full-text indexing of body text and speaker notes.",
      "合并、重排、拆分、中文矢量水印与高清转图，支持入库或直接导出到本地。": "Merge, reorder, split, watermark, and render PDFs — save to the library or export straight to disk.",
      "压缩包透视与表格分析": "Archive Peek & Data Tables",
      "免解压直搜 ZIP/TAR 内部文件并按需提取，内置 CSV/XLSX/JSON 虚拟表格与图表。": "Search and extract files inside ZIP/TAR without unpacking, plus fast CSV/XLSX/JSON tables and charts.",
      "Office 文档透视镜": "Office Lens",
